{"baseRefName":"fix/security-boundaries","baseRefOid":"1d4ce5202a32759766b1425396aec988a5e30bcf","body":"## Summary\n\nStacked on #543 (security boundaries). Last tranche of the lifecycle-hardening audit — four independent defects, four commits:\n\n- **`runYtDlpProcess` gets an `idleTimeoutMs` liveness bound.** `--socket-timeout` only bounds a hung read — a server dribbling bytes, or a fragment retry loop, keeps the process alive without ever producing a progress line, and the download job sat forever. Every stdout/stderr line re-arms the timer; expiry appends a `treating as wedged` marker to bounded stderr and runs the existing SIGTERM → SIGKILL path. `DownloadService` wires 120s — silence that long is a wedge, not a slow download. Known limit: any line counts as liveness, including repetitive retry spam — yt-dlp's own `--retries` bound covers that; this bound covers silence.\n- **`killActiveProcessesSync` sends SIGTERM before SIGKILL.** A bare KILL orphaned yt-dlp's own children (an in-flight ffmpeg merge is a child process). Signals queue in order, so a responsive child starts its reap before the KILL lands; the KILL sweep still covers a wedged one.\n- **Stale mpv IPC artifact sweep.** A crashed session left `kunai-mpv-*.sock` files — and since #543, `*.sock.conf` credential files — in the private IPC dir. Endpoint creation now kicks a once-per-process sweep: a socket that refuses a connect is dead and unlinked with its conf; an answering socket is a live instance's and is left alone. A conf with no socket sibling is only removed when old, so an in-flight spawn's conf (written before mpv binds) is never swept out from under it.\n- **Config writes serialize.** Two overlapping `store.write` calls could complete out of order — atomic rename makes one write crash-safe but can't order two, so an older snapshot's rename landing after a newer one was last-write-loses. Saves now chain on `saveInFlight`; `reset()` joins the same ordering.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `spawn-ytdlp.test.ts`: idle expiry kills + records the wedge; an output line re-arms the timer (kill lands ~160ms in, not ~80ms); no `idleTimeoutMs` leaves silence alone. 10/10 pass.\n- [x] `mpv-ipc-endpoint.test.ts`: dead socket + conf unlinked, live pair untouched; aged orphan conf removed, fresh in-flight conf survives.\n- [x] `config-save-debounce.test.ts`: held write A can no longer land after write B — landed order is scheduling order.\n- [x] Full pre-push gate: 26 tasks, 5966 unit + 296 integration, 0 fail.","files":[{"path":".docs/download-offline-onboarding.md","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":".docs/providers.md","additions":7,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/infra/player/mpv-ipc-endpoint.ts","additions":98,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/services/download/DownloadService.ts","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/src/services/persistence/ConfigServiceImpl.ts","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/test/unit/mpv-ipc-endpoint.test.ts","additions":68,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/cli/test/unit/services/persistence/config-save-debounce.test.ts","additions":41,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/src/youtube/spawn-ytdlp.ts","additions":30,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"packages/providers/test/youtube/spawn-ytdlp.test.ts","additions":110,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"fix/lifecycle-lows","headRefOid":"dfac31be4b28f9bd6695c79e6bde2dc5a17ad9f5","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":544,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:36:46Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37078387725/job/111073278054","name":"Path filters","startedAt":"2026-10-02T23:36:38Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt